---
import SolutionPage from '../../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="EMF Mitigation"
  parent="Mitigate"
  oneliner="Chronic low-level EMF exposure is an uncontrolled experiment — and your bedroom is the highest-exposure room in the house."
  slug="environment-emf"
  canonicalPath="/solutions/environment/emf"
  showSolutionPath={false}
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <!-- ── Why This Matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Human biology did not evolve in a constant-RF environment — the proliferating Wi-Fi-connected devices in modern homes represent chronic low-grade biological stress with no historical parallel</li>
    <li>The precautionary principle applies with minimal downside: interventions that reduce EMF exposure have zero cost and negligible inconvenience — if there's a measurable biological effect, you've eliminated it; if not, you've lost nothing</li>
    <li>The bedroom is the critical target — you spend 7–8 hours there nightly at close range to whatever devices live there; a router on the nightstand is the highest practical exposure scenario and the easiest to fix</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Featured Products — E-Commerce Hero ── -->
  <h2 class="section-eliminate">Featured Products</h2>
  <p>Protocol-matched products for EMF mitigation. Affiliate relationships disclosed below.</p>
  <div class="product-grid">
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>EMF-Shielding Bed Canopy / Bedding</h3>
      <p class="product-why">High-attenuation shielding for your sleep environment — protects 7–8 hours of close-range exposure nightly.</p>
      <p>Silver-thread fabric canopy or fitted sheet. For high-exposure bedroom situations (adjacent router, smart meter, multi-unit buildings).</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=emf-shielding-bedding -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: EMF-Shielding Bedding" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Faraday Phone Cases</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Eliminates RF exposure from pocket carry without requiring airplane mode.</p>
      <p>Signal-blocking phone pouch for daily carry. Effective attenuation for front-pocket and desk use.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=faraday-phone-case -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: Faraday Phone Case" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>Low-EMF Router</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Adjustable transmit power — many routers broadcast at far higher output than your space requires.</p>
      <p>Router with tunable RF output. Reduce transmission power to the minimum needed for your coverage area.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=low-emf-router -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: Low-EMF Router" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-card">
      <h3>EMF Meter</h3>
      <p class="product-why">Map actual exposure levels in your home so you can prioritize mitigation by source — not guesswork.</p>
      <p>Handheld RF and ELF measurement meter. Know your actual exposure before buying mitigation hardware.</p>
      <span class="notify-pill">Notify Me When Available</span>
      <!-- TODO: wire to Stripe Checkout when shop is live — /api/checkout?sku=emf-meter -->
      <a href="mailto:hello@my4mlife.com?subject=Pre-order: EMF Meter" class="btn-cart">Notify Me →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Deeper Protocol ── -->
  <h2>The Deeper Protocol</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Smartphone in front pocket all day — proximity maximizes exposure across the most sensitive tissue</li>
    <li>Router in or adjacent to the bedroom — broadcasting full-power RF 24 hours a day</li>
    <li>Sleeping with your phone charging on the nightstand — 6–8 hours of close-range exposure during recovery</li>
    <li>Wi-Fi-connected devices throughout every room — cumulative ambient RF load with no off-state</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Fix sequence: phone out of the bedroom tonight (free, immediate) → router on an outlet timer during sleep hours (costs ~$10) →
    hardwire stationary devices via ethernet → EMF meter to map remaining hot spots → shielding hardware for anything you can't move or turn off.
  </p>

  <a href="/blog/eliminate-the-insulting-behavior-environment" class="blog-deepdive-btn">
    Read More: Full Environmental Protocol →
  </a>

  <p style="margin-top:1.5rem; font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--text-light);">
    <em>Affiliate disclosure: My4MLife may earn a commission on purchases made through product links on this page. All products are independently evaluated against the My4MLife protocol standards before inclusion.</em>
  </p>

  <!-- ── Optional Protégé footer ── -->
  <div class="protege-card">
    Want personalized guidance on your environmental protocol? <strong>Become a Protégé free</strong> — the My4MLife App walks you through environmental optimization week by week.
    <a href="https://app.my4mlife.com" class="protege-link">Join My4MLife →</a>
  </div>
</SolutionPage>

<style>
.product-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.25rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
}
.product-card {
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s, transform 0.18s;
}
.product-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,184,148,0.14);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.product-card h3 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0;
}
.product-why {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin: 0 !important;
}
.product-card p {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  margin: 0;
  flex: 1;
}
.notify-pill {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--accent);
  background: rgba(0,184,148,0.1);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,148,0.35);
  padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  align-self: flex-start;
  margin-top: 0.25rem;
}
.btn-cart {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.45rem 1.1rem;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  align-self: flex-start;
  transition: background 0.15s;
}
.btn-cart:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }

.blog-deepdive-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 0.75rem 0 2rem;
  padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem;
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
}
.blog-deepdive-btn:hover {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
}

.protege-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,184,148,0.06) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 1rem 0 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  align-items: center;
}
.protege-link {
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.protege-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
